<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka Kegalle up 4.5 pct on results.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka Kegalle up 4.5 pct on results.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Kegalle Plantations Ltd rose 4.55 percent or 1.50 rupees on Tuesday due to good interim results, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;As the results announced this morning are good, there is buying of the share,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The company said three-month net profits to June had risen 38.5 percent to 27.82 million rupees.</p>
<p>Kegalle Plantations, which owns and manages tea and rubber estates, is a unit of John Keells Holdings.</p>
<p>--- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
